## Freshness in Action

1. On first visit, the app fetches from IPFS, saves the cache with a timestamp.
2. Seven days later, the cache is stale—the next page load will re‑fetch.
3. If the user clicks **Update from Source**, it ignores the cache and pulls fresh data immediately.
